      "originalText": "// Domain Layer — aucune annotation\nclass Trip {\n  bookSeat() {\n    if (this.seats === 0) throw new TripFull();\n    this.seats--;\n  }\n}\n\n// Infrastructure Layer\n@Entity()\nclass TripRecord {\n  @Id() id: string;\n  @Column() seats: number;\n}\n\nclass TripMapper {\n  toDomain(r: TripRecord): Trip { … }\n  toRecord(t: Trip): TripRecord { … }\n}",
      "x": 970,
      "y": 68,
      "text": "// Domain Layer — aucune annotation\nclass Trip {\n  bookSeat() {\n    if (this.seats === 0) throw new TripFull();\n    this.seats--;\n  }\n}\n\n// Infrastructure Layer\n@Entity()\nclass TripRecord {\n  @Id() id: string;\n  @Column() seats: number;\n}\n\nclass TripMapper {\n  toDomain(r: TripRecord): Trip { … }\n  toRecord(t: Trip): TripRecord { … }\n}"
